Subject: [PATCH 1/3] fix(sim): check vertical milling rapids against the part

Sweep modeled vertical milling rapids in both directions and attribute a blocking RapidInPart warning to the crossing move. Preserve peck stock columns and nose-center turning verification.

Co-Authored-By: OpenAI Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #4062
